WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
We are Wahaj.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Six personalities. Each with a different strength.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
An idea brought us together.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Every one of us has a spark.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
We bring it to light.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
We called it Wahaj — a glow.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Our light is stronger together.

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Created by Mohamed Elmalahi.
